          "type": "debt",
          "priority": "medium",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-31T15:49:31Z",
          "note": "Several existing GUI test files (e.g. `api.test.ts`, `api-run-metadata.test.ts`) still use `join(tmpdir(), slug)` as the planPath, which causes `LedgerStore.repoName` to resolve to `'unknown'` rather than a proper namespace. These files have inline `createProject` helpers that bypass the namespaced layout. They should be migrated to `createNamespacedProject` when those tests need to cover namespaced API routes. Not in scope for WP-003."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "qa",
